⸫ ᚤᚲ ⟨ ℤ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⊸ ⟦ ℤ ⟧ ⟩ ⦃ ⦃ ○ ⦄ ⦃ ⦄ ⁇ ⊘ △▽△ ᚤᚱ ⦄

ᚤᚳ toks path: the plane table and the index of the records (breaths included) ⍝
⦃
  ⧖ ⧖
  ⧗̱⁰ ⧗̱¹ ⟦ ○ ⟧ ⟦ ○ ⟧ ○▽△ ▽
  the loop carries [toks path P X j cur] ⍝
  ⥀ ⦃
