---- compile-time values: an entry with a known value carries c ⍝

ᚣᚤᛔ C e: the evaluator value [ty n ok role hasn] of entry e, or −1 when not known ⍝
⦃
  ⧖ ⧖
  ⧗̵⁰ ⧗¹ ᚡᚧᛚ ⧖ ⧖ ⧗̵⁰ ⧗³ ᚡᚧᛜ ⧖ ⧖ ⧗̵⁰ ⧗⁵ △△ ᚡᚡᛓ ⧖ ⧖ ⧗̵⁰ ⧗⁷ ▽▽△ ᚡᚡᛓ ⧖ ⧖
  ⧖ ⧖ ᚧᛢ ○▽▽△ ⧗⁹ ⧗̵⁰ ⧖ ⧖ ᚡᚧᛝ ⧗⁷ ⧗̵⁰
  ⧗̵⁰ △○▽▽△ ᚡᚧᛋ ⧖ ⧖ ⧗̵⁰ ▽△▽▽△ ᚡᚧᛋ ⧖ ⧖
